WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.140
Three days after surgery, you may shower and

2
00:00:04.204 --> 00:00:05.180
wash your hair.

3
00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:08.540
Your wound check and ear exam are about

4
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.780
two weeks after surgery —

5
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.620
the stitches dissolve on their own.

6
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.620
Take your antibiotic the way it was prescribed.

7
00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:17.700
It helps prevent infection.

8
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.900
Take your pain medicine the way it was

9
00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:20.700
prescribed.

10
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.180
Take it before the pain gets bad.
